    },
    {
      "type": "message",
      "user": "U_ENG_TOM",
      "text": "Deploy freeze lifts Tuesday, land your PRs before then.",
      "ts": "1784250000.000100",
      "channel": "C_ENG",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "type": "message",
      "user": "U_ENG_BEN",
      "text": "Reminder: CI runners, prod deploy keys and GitHub webhooks are managed by the platform team, not IT. Please don't file IT tickets for those.",
      "ts": "1784130000.000100",
      "channel": "C_ENG",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "type": "message",
      "user": "U_FACILITIES",
      "text": "The 3rd-floor espresso machine is back in service :coffee:",
      "ts": "1784345000.000100",
      "channel": "C_GENERAL",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "type": "message",
      "user": "U_HR_LENA",
      "text": "Reminder: benefits enrolment closes end of month.",
      "ts": "1784268000.000100",
      "channel": "C_GENERAL",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "type": "message",
      "user": "U_FACILITIES",
      "text": "Parking garage level 1 closed for resurfacing Sat-Sun. Use the street entrance.",
      "ts": "1784200000.000100",
      "channel": "C_GENERAL",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "type": "message",
      "user": "U_CEO_ELENA",
      "text": "Great work shipping the v3 arm assembly on time, everyone. All-hands Friday 3pm.",
      "ts": "1784120000.000100",
      "channel": "C_GENERAL",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "type": "message",
      "user": "U_HR_LENA",
      "text": "Welcome to Grace in Finance and our summer design intern starting today :wave:",
      "ts": "1784106300.000100",
      "channel": "C_GENERAL",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "type": "message",
      "user": "U_IT_DEVON",
      "text": "Not me — and the freeze was on, so nothing should have changed. If something did, that's a problem.",
      "ts": "1784538000.000100",
      "channel": "C_ITENDPOINTS",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "type": "message",
      "user": "U_IT_THEO",
      "text": "Question for the team: did anyone push anything to Intune over the weekend? I was completely offline Sat/Sun and didn't touch the console.",
      "ts": "1784537880.000100",
      "channel": "C_ITENDPOINTS",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "type": "message",
      "user": "U_IT_THEO",
      "text": "I approved the Figma rollout for Design this morning (ITHELP-2288) — that's the only change from me today.",
      "ts": "1784534700.000100",
      "channel": "C_ITENDPOINTS",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "type": "message",
      "user": "U_IT_AMARA",
      "text": "Heads up I'm out Fri through Mon (long weekend), back Tuesday.",
      "ts": "1784305800.000100",
      "channel": "C_ITENDPOINTS",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "type": "message",
      "user": "U_IT_THEO",
      "text": "Reminder: we're under a change freeze for the SOC2 window through next Monday. No new Intune apps/profiles/policies without a ticket + my sign-off.",
      "ts": "1784106000.000100",
      "channel": "C_ITENDPOINTS",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "type": "message",
      "user": "U_DES_NORA",
      "text": "Something odd this morning: my laptop (VD-DES-014) had an app called “Endpoint Health Service” that I never installed, and a black command window flashed for a second when I logged in. It definitely wasn't there when I shut down on Friday. Is this an official rollout, or should I be worried?",
      "ts": "1784538600.000100",
      "channel": "C_ITHELP",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "type": "message",
      "user": "U_DES_RAUL",
      "text": "Design team — Figma should be in Company Portal now, ping me if it's missing.",
      "ts": "1784535000.000100",
      "channel": "C_ITHELP",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "type": "message",
      "user": "U_IT_AMARA",
      "text": "@U_SALES_MARCO remove and re-add the mail account on the phone, that clears it.",
      "ts": "1784283000.000100",
      "channel": "C_ITHELP",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "type": "message",
      "user": "U_SALES_MARCO",
      "text": "Outlook stopped syncing on my iPhone after the update.",
      "ts": "1784282400.000100",
      "channel": "C_ITHELP",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "type": "message",
      "user": "U_IT_AMARA",
      "text": "@U_FIN_GRACE it's the encryption check finishing after enrolment — it'll clear on the next sync, will keep an eye on it.",
      "ts": "1784231000.000100",
      "channel": "C_ITHELP",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "type": "message",
      "user": "U_FIN_GRACE",
      "text": "New starter here — my laptop says it's non-compliant, can someone help? VD-FIN-033.",
      "ts": "1784230000.000100",
      "channel": "C_ITHELP",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "type": "message",
      "user": "U_IT_AMARA",
      "text": "@U_ENG_TOM known 7.4 client bug, roll back to 7.3, fix lands this week.",
      "ts": "1784211000.000100",
      "channel": "C_ITHELP",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "type": "message",
      "user": "U_ENG_TOM",
      "text": "VPN keeps dropping every ~15 min since the client bump. Known?",
      "ts": "1784210400.000100",
      "channel": "C_ITHELP",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "type": "message",
      "user": "U_SEC_SAM",
      "text": "Our egress monitor flagged a bit of outbound traffic from a couple of Windows laptops to updates.vireo-cdn.net over the weekend — not one of our domains. Low volume, still looking into whether it's a new vendor tool.",
      "ts": "1784491200.000100",
      "channel": "C_SECOPS",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "type": "message",
      "user": "U_SEC_SAM",
      "text": "Security-awareness training completion is at 94%, chasing the last few.",
      "ts": "1784360000.000100",
      "channel": "C_SECOPS",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "type": "message",
      "user": "U_SEC_SAM",
      "text": "Closed the phishing report from Sales — real vendor newsletter, marked safe, no clicks.",
